ethods of analysis. Chem. Phys. Lipids. 2018;216:114–131. doi: 10.1016/j.chemphyslip.2018.08.003. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 17. Watanabe K., Kuramitsu S., Posey A.D., Jr., June C.H. Expanding the Therapeutic Window for CAR T Cell Therapy in Solid Tumors: The Knowns and Unknowns of CAR T Cell Biology. Front. Immunol. 2018;9:2486. doi: 10.3389/fimmu.2018.02486. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Xu R., Greening D.W., Zhu H.J., Takahashi N., Simpson R.J. Extracellular vesicle isolation and characterization: Toward clinical application. J. Clin. Investig. 2016;126:1152–1162. doi: 10.1172/JCI81129. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Pandit A.B., Kumar J.K. Clean Water for Developing Countries. Annu. Rev. Chem. Biomol. Eng. 2015;6:217–246. doi: 10.1146/annurev-chembioeng-061114-123432. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Li P. To Make the Water Safer. Expo. Health. 2020;12:337–342. doi: 10.1007/s12403-020-00370-9. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Lasram M.M., Annabi A.B., El Elj N., Selmi S., Kamoun A., El-Fazaa S., Gharbi N. Metabolic disorders of acute exposure to malathion in adult Wistar rats. J. Hazard. Mater. 2009;163:1052–1055. doi: 10.1016/j.jhazmat.2008.07.059. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Lin C.Y., Lee H.L., Hwang Y.T., Wang C., Hsieh C.J., Wu C., Sung F.C., Su T.C. The association between urine di-(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate metabolites, global DNA methylation, and subclinical atherosclerosis in a young Taiwanese population. Environ. Pollut. 2020;265 Pt B:114912. doi: 10.1016/j.envpol.2020.114912. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Singh A.V., Romeo A., Scott K., Wagener S., Leibrock L., Laux P., Luch A., Kerkar P., Balakrishnan S., Dakua S.P., et al. Emerging Technologies for In Vitro Inhalation Toxicology. Adv. Healthc. Mater. 2021;10:e2100633. doi: 10.1002/adhm.202100633. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Googl